= Antitrust Action

Corporatations have for far too long been held unaccountable for their monopolistic practices. We must bring the full power of the law upon corporations who are engaged in these practices.

- @war_with_tech
- @sue_big_agri
- @junk_fees
- @transport_mon
- @root: Do not enact any policies for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@war_with_tech
title: Sue Big Tech Companies Such As Amazon And Meta
subtitle: This will lead to a drawn out legal battle and will radicalize the tech sector towards the right. 
on-arrival: big_tech_lawsuit +=1; corporate_backlash +=5; tech_ideology +=10; socialist_strength +=5; socialist_dissent -=5; progressive_dissent -=5; bop_econ -=0.75
max-visits: 1

